WEBVTT

00:23:28.736 --> 00:23:32.914
you could imagine a government
that maybe started out benign,

00:23:32.938 --> 00:23:36.680
but had been seduced by power
and really wanted complete control.

00:23:37.003 --> 00:23:39.861
It feels like in China,
it's even harder to have that debate,

00:23:39.885 --> 00:23:42.735
because if you have that debate
too rigorously or seriously,

00:23:42.759 --> 00:23:47.157
you get your own
social-credit score marked down.

00:23:47.181 --> 00:23:48.212
(CA laughs)

00:23:48.236 --> 00:23:50.001
KFL: (Laughs) No, I don't think so.

00:23:50.025 --> 00:23:54.649
Actually, the Chinese government
cares a lot about what people think.

00:23:54.673 --> 00:23:57.768
And the feedback loop does exist.

00:23:57.792 --> 00:24:02.395
While it's not the same feedback loop
as in the American government system,